0..45 Comment "//! This source shows named effect instances."
46..49 Comment "//!"
50..112 Comment "//! A label distinguishes one interface instance from another."
113..158 Comment "//! A call can pass an instance by its label."
159..237 Comment "//! The label is a parameter that the function abstracts after every parameter"
238..252 Comment "//! it writes."
253..256 Comment "//!"
257..332 Comment "//! The checker resolves an omitted label from a capability scope or from a"
333..412 Comment "//! label of the row of the caller [Brachthauser-2020-effects_as_capabilities]."
413..475 Comment "//! It keeps each labelled instance separate from the default."
476..479 Comment "//!"
480..496 Comment "//! - see: #2271"
497..556 Comment "//! - see: ../../pathological/control/named-instances.gandr"
557..613 Comment "//! - cites: [Brachthauser-2020-effects_as_capabilities]"
